		{
			description: [
				"Aquaculture expands fish by biome and adds rods, hooks, bait and tackle. Start with a durable iron rod and compare upgrades in JEI."
				"Aquaculture replaces one generic fishing loop with fish, hooks, tackle, treasure, and biome-aware catches. Use the Tackle Box to inspect equipment and change one component at a time so its effect is understandable."
				"Hooks trade durability or specialised behaviour for different fishing goals. JEI shows their recipes, while actual catches reveal whether the chosen water, biome, weather, and patience match the species being sought."
				"Before marking this lesson complete, identify every named block, item, creature, or interface in JEI and Jade. Inspect both recipes and uses, then perform one small manual test so the objective represents understood behaviour rather than a lucky craft."
