		{
			description: [
				"The pack adds wildlife with very different temperaments. Read Jade, watch posture and sound, and avoid assuming that every unfamiliar creature is either harmless or meant to be killed."
				"Carry a boat, leads, food and a few empty containers. Many useful encounters are opportunities to relocate, tame, photograph or study something rather than collect a drop."
				"When a species seems rare, leave a breeding population behind. A living landmark is worth more than one extra item."
